WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.120
Packages: event packages with options and a per-guest price; an event's price = package × guests + options.

2
00:00:10.669 --> 00:00:15.100
Click "New package" and set the "Base price" and "Price per guest".

3
00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:19.930
Set "Min guests" and "Max guests" and add the "Options".

4
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.960
In "Related words (automatic choice)", write the names customers use.

5
00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:30.940
A package used by an event isn't deleted but switched off.
